#. i18n: tag scalar
#. i18n: file element_tiny.xml line 136
#: rc.cpp:560
msgid ""
"Holmium is an artificial Latin name created after 'holm', the second part of "
"the compound name of the city of Stockholm; the word does not exist in the "
"Latin language, the great city of Stockholm is not recorded anywhere as "
"existing before the 12th century and the Roman Legions never marched that "
"far north anyway."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag scalar
#. i18n: file element_tiny.xml line 138
#: rc.cpp:563
