"Named ofter the Swedish town of Ytterby. Terbium and Ytterbium are also "
"named after this town."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag scalar
#. i18n: file element_tiny.xml line 140
#: rc.cpp:566
msgid ""
"Named after the Greek 'Thule', the name the Greek explorer Pitheas gave to "
"Greenland when he explored the British Islands, Iceland and Greenland; a "
"small town in Greenland is called Thule today."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: tag scalar
#. i18n: file element_tiny.xml line 142
#: rc.cpp:569
msgid ""
"Like Terbium and Gadolinium. this is named after the Swedish town of Ytterby"
